OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA bright start to the day and
OL,6,Fmostly dry for the first part of the
OL,7,Fmorning but showers developing by late
OL,8,Fmorning, a few showers turning heavy,
OL,9,Fwith some thunder possible in the
OL,10,Fafternoon.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FHeavier showers dying out
OL,13,Fthrough the evening but lighter
OL,14,Fshowers continuing through the night,
OL,15,Fperhaps drier for Borders, feeling
OL,16,Fcooler with freshening northeasterly
OL,17,Fwinds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
