OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FQuite breezy and feeling
OL,6,Ffresher with some showers, these
OL,7,Fmostly light and moving away quite
OL,8,Fbriskly.
OL,9,
OL,10,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FRemaining
OL,11,Fon the cool side but a lot of bright
OL,12,Fweather for the weekend with
OL,13,Foccasional showers, perhaps cloudier
OL,14,Flater on Sunday.
